            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#16161A' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='11'>What this store is. </run>
              <run fontcolor='#55555E' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='11'>155 incidents raised by seven models on public datasets. Every timestamp is real. The operational context - people, lines, shifts - is simulated, and so are the response times: a demo crew inside the live plant acknowledges and closes on a schedule, so cards 3 and 4 measure that emitter, not a workforce. Source: the n8n incident status API. github.com/sergey-kasatov/arkon-manufacturing-ai</run>
            </formatted-text>
